# ---- clip layer (item 164): the game's full-screen VIDEO LAYER. Its own sequences ("SinisterModeTotal")
# add the layer to the display stack at priority 5 and ask the layer's video object for a clip by name;
# the video bank's surface alone is not on the glass here. An added clip was seen on the glass in the
# emulator 2026-09-25 (attract and a game; the HUD back when the layer is removed).
site layer_add        0x000e05d8 0xe30eca64 0xe1a03002
site layer_remove     0x000e05f0 0xe92d40f8 0xe5913004
